        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Solve the equation <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 5ky-13=7]</span> for the variable <span class=\"math\">[MATH: y.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Solve the equation [MATH: 5ky-13=7] for the variable [MATH: y.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We need to isolate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: y.]</span> To do this, we first add <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 13]</span> to both sides of the equation:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 5ky \u2212 13|= 7; 5ky \u2212 13 + 13|= 7 + 13; 5ky|= 20]</span></p><p>Then, we divide both sides of the equation by <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 5k\\mathbin{:}]</span></p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 5ky|= 20; (5ky)/(5k)|= (20)/(5k); (5ky)/(5k)|= (20)/(5k); y|= (20)/(5k)]</span></p><p>Finally, we can further simplify the right-hand side:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: y|= (5 \u22c5 4)/(5k); y|= (5 \u22c5 4)/(5k); y|= (4)/(k)]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We need to isolate [MATH: y.] To do this, we first add [MATH: 13] to both sides of the equation:\n\n[MATH: 5ky \u2212 13|= 7; 5ky \u2212 13 + 13|= 7 + 13; 5ky|= 20]\n\nThen, we divide both sides of the equation by [MATH: 5k\\mathbin{:}]\n\n[MATH: 5ky|= 20; (5ky)/(5k)|= (20)/(5k); (5ky)/(5k)|= (20)/(5k); y|= (20)/(5k)]\n\nFinally, we can further simplify the right-hand side:\n\n[MATH: y|= (5 \u22c5 4)/(5k); y|= (5 \u22c5 4)/(5k); y|= (4)/(k)]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nSolve the equation [MATH: 5ky-13=7] for the variable [MATH: y.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe need to isolate [MATH: y.] To do this, we first add [MATH: 13] to both sides of the equation:\n\n[MATH: 5ky \u2212 13|= 7; 5ky \u2212 13 + 13|= 7 + 13; 5ky|= 20]\n\nThen, we divide both sides of the equation by [MATH: 5k\\mathbin{:}]\n\n[MATH: 5ky|= 20; (5ky)/(5k)|= (20)/(5k); (5ky)/(5k)|= (20)/(5k); y|= (20)/(5k)]\n\nFinally, we can further simplify the right-hand side:\n\n[MATH: y|= (5 \u22c5 4)/(5k); y|= (5 \u22c5 4)/(5k); y|= (4)/(k)]"
      },
