        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nSolve the equation [MATH: \\dfrac{1}{3} = -\\dfrac{ax}{5}] for the variable [MATH: x.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe need to isolate [MATH: x.] To do this, we first cross-multiply:\n\n[MATH: (1)/(3)|= \u2212 (ax)/(5); (1)/(3)|= (\u2212 ax)/(5); 5 \u22c5 1|= 3 \u22c5 (\u2212 ax); 5|= \u2212 3ax]\n\nThen, we divide both sides of the equation by [MATH: -3a\\mathbin{:}]\n\n[MATH: 5|= \u2212 3ax; (5)/(\u2212 3a)|= (\u2212 3ax)/(\u2212 3a); (5)/(\u2212 3a)|= (\u2212 3ax)/(\u2212 3a); \u2212 (5)/(3a)|= x; x|= \u2212 (5)/(3a)]"
